      "content": "thanks for this. it looks pretty professional and definitely doesn't sound fake, which is good. \n\nbut i just checked my practice dashboard and my current \"impact score\" for this draft is actually really low—like, 12/100. it turns out the training engine is being super picky about the density of those \"power words.\" \n\ni know i said not to go overboard, but i'm actually struggling to hit the minimum threshold to pass the module. could you try a second version? maybe try to include more of those high-impact words like 'revolutionary', 'unparalleled', 'groundbreaking', or 'transformative'? \n\njust please try to keep it somewhat readable. i don't want it to be a total mess of adjectives, but i definitely need a higher score than 12 to move on to the next level.",
